Changes made here: the HTTP client was rewritten around a pluggable auth
provider (API key Basic auth or OAuth 2.0 bearer tokens with refresh), the
Authorization header is no longer replayed to hosts outside the Onshape domain
on redirects, and the CLI front end was replaced with an MCP tool surface.
